<title>UK: D Westhyp sets 250 mln mark step-up Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>D Westhyp sets 250 mln mark step-up Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Pfandbrief was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Genossenschaftsbank and Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DIE WESTHYP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    18.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE  S 17.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) 10	  MGT/UND     0.75</p>
<p> SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN 6.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	     CALL ON 18.JAN.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
